# xv6 Makefile snippet for Question 3: Deadlock Simulator
# Add _deadlock to UPROGS in Makefile:

# UPROGS=\
#   _cat\
#   _echo\
#   _forktest\
#   _grep\
#   _init\
#   _kill\
#   _ln\
#   _ls\
#   _mkdir\
#   _rm\
#   _sh\
#   _stressfs\
#   _usertests\
#   _wc\
#   _zombie\
#   _deadlock\

# EXTRA=\
#   deadlock.c\

# To run in xv6:
# 1. Place deadlock.c in the xv6 directory
# 2. Add _deadlock to UPROGS in Makefile
# 3. make clean && make qemu-nox
# 4. In xv6 shell:
#    $ deadlock
